  "2026-11-27T22:25:14.902Z",codex-agent,"Reviewing import ownership, the gated repeat check, and closeout before adding a native related edge from the mirror."
  "2026-11-27T22:25:29.054Z",codex-agent,"Reproduced on main with a real non-git tracker: a tagged in-progress Chore plus an open GitHub issue creates the mirror and neither item has a dependency. The pinned SDK provides undirected, non-ordering related relationships. Write the source edge on the mirror only so the citing item and its history stay byte-identical."
